[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid.</p><p>Ensure the battery is disconnected.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air-bag front sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428497\">K39</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the nut.</p><p>3. Recover the sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2052933.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the sensor is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Position the sensor and secure it using\nthe nut.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Check the operation of the system using\nthe Examiner.</p>"]]